        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "The ward speaks Greek, and mostly it takes",
          "the words whole: nouns lifted out of the",
          "language with the ending changed and",
          "nothing else.",
          "",
          "  therapy   θεραπεία    attendance",
          "  clinic    κλινική     of the bed",
          "  trauma    τραῦμα      a wound",
          "  asthma    ἄσθμα       panting",
          "",
          "A therapist once waited on you, and a",
          "klinikos was the doctor who came to the",
          "bedside.",
          "",
          "Diet is the trap. Diaita was a whole way",
          "of living, sleep and air as much as food.",
          "",
          "THE NEXT 20 CARDS: medicine taken whole."
