          "  asterisk      star + little",
          "  astrolabe     star + taker",
          "  biosphere     life + ball",
          "",
          "Disaster is an ill-starred day, Italian",
          "dis on Greek astro: the stars were held",
          "to be against you.",
          "",
          "The sky is filed in spheres: iono-,",
